                                                "example_id": "45ba1c47-bc8d-484f-bdda-b335b3c73773",
                                                "sense_id": "eb9f7005-7d6f-32fd-b0f6-5f896f7ae491",
                                                "text": "In consequence of this it was impossible to send out messengers to announce the coming of the festivals, and therefore the Patriarch Hillel, with the consent of the Sanhedrim determined to reveal the secret of the calendic calculation."
